                        <div class="row" style="font-size:15px;" name="terms_and_conditions">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <span>
                                    <span>Delivery Terms:</span>
                                    <br/>
                                    1. Ensure that the goods are received by Buyer in good condition compliance with the
                                    Purchase Order
                                    <br/>
                                    2. All invoices shall be issued in the currency as set out in the Purchase Order
                                    <br/>
                                    3. Any credit memos due to Buyer's organization shall be transacted within five (5)
                                    business days
                                    <br/>
                                    4. Title and risk of loss shall pass to Buyer upon delivery at the destination
